  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Get a page of matching elements for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> and provide a custom <a href=\"../domain/Specification.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.domain\"><code>count\nspecification</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取与<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>匹配的元素的页面，并提供自定义的<a href=\"../domain/Specification.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.domain\"><code>count specification</code></a>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>countSpec</code> - specification used to count results.",
      "translation": "<code>countSpec</code> - 用于统计结果的规范。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Extension to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/FluentQuery.FetchableFluentQuery.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>FluentQuery.FetchableFluentQuery</code></a> allowing slice results and pagination with a custom count\n<a href=\"../domain/Specification.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.domain\"><code>Specification</code></a>.",
      "translation": "扩展 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/FluentQuery.FetchableFluentQuery.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>FluentQuery.FetchableFluentQuery</code></a>，支持带有自定义计数的切片结果和分页功能。\n<a href=\"../domain/Specification.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.domain\"><code>Specification</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>pageable</code> - the pageable to request a paged result, can be <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#unpaged()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>, must not be\n         null. The given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> will override any previously specified <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>sort</code></a> if\n         the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> object is not <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html#isUnsorted()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.isUnsorted()</code></a>. Any potentially specified <a href=\"#limit(int)\"><code>limit(int)</code></a>\n         will be overridden by <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable.getPageSize()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>pageable</code> - 用于请求分页结果的 pageable 对象，可以是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#unpaged()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>，且不能为 null。如果给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 中的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>sort</code></a> 对象不是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html#isUnsorted()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.isUnsorted()</code></a>，则它将覆盖之前指定的任何 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>sort</code></a>。任何可能指定的 <a href=\"#limit(int)\"><code>limit(int)</code></a> 都将被 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable.getPageSize()</code></a> 覆盖。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>pageable</code> - the pageable to request a paged result, can be <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#unpaged()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>, must not be\n         null. The given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> will override any previously specified <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>sort</code></a>.\n         Any potentially specified <a href=\"#limit(int)\"><code>limit(int)</code></a> will be overridden by <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable.getPageSize()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>pageable</code> - 用于请求分页结果的 pageable 对象，可以是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#unpaged()\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类或接口\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>，且不能为 null。给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类或接口\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 将覆盖之前指定的任何 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类或接口\"><code>sort</code></a>。任何可能指定的 <a href=\"#limit(int)\"><code>limit(int)</code></a> 都将被 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类或接口\"><code>Pageable.getPageSize()</code></a> 覆盖。",
      "count": 1
    },
